      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Not sure if the buttons behavior have change since then,  but held down are working perfectly fine as show here for each type of parameter. The value stay until you release it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
